  "usage_note": "**Enough** used alone or with **of** is a pronoun; directly before a noun, with no **of**, it is a determiner (**[[enough-det|enough]]** *time*). After an adjective or adverb (*good enough*), **enough** is an adverb. All three are separate entries.",
